/godot/pull/112329.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"> [!NOTE]\r\n> There's no open issue/proposal for this AFAIK; I've based on this comment on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98379#issuecomment-2707587950 that this was a desired feature\r\n\r\nThis adds support for debugging multiple threads through DAP, bringing feature parity with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/76582.\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1a2d5b9f-e28b-4de0-97aa-b7eab34dbef2\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n> This includes some misc changes ranging from code cleanups to fixing bad behaviors from the spec. If desired, I can separate them in other dependent PRs\r\n\r\n> [!WARNING]\r\n> This implementation is not perfect, and some issues/odd behaviors are coming from Godot itself. This serves as a first implementation, but subsequent work is planned to make multi-thread debugging more robust, both from Godot and DAP.\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112329/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112329/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}